    O.e D.δ (pl F τ) = cc • (O.X D τ 0 1 * O.X D τ 1 0 - O.X D τ 0 0 * O.X D τ 1 1) ∧
    O.f D.δ (pl F τ) = (-cc⁻¹) • (O.DX D τ 0 1 * O.DX D τ 1 0 - O.DX D τ 0 0 * O.DX D τ 1 1) ∧
    O.h (pl F τ) = (∑ a, ∑ b, O.X D τ a b * O.DX D τ a b) + 2 := by
